## 📌 Executive Summary

This report provides a detailed breakdown of the user stories, technical requirements, MVP boundaries, and UI/UX design specifications for **"Un Vrai Réseau Social"**.

- **Core Value Proposition:** A mobile-first social discovery web app connecting people to arrange **in-person, real-world meetings** (*des rencontres en vrai*) around shared passions, interests, and educational topics.
- **Monetization & Payment Handling:** Peer-to-peer model. Users define their hourly rates, but **all financial transactions occur in person outside the platform**. The app handles discovery, matching, and messaging only. Currency is strictly **Euro (€)**.
- **Platform Scope:** **100% Smartphone Mobile Web Application**. Desktop/tablet views are out of scope for MVP.
- **Design Mockup Directive:** Provided design files (`Landing Page`, `Profile Page`, `Chats Page`) are for **aesthetic/layout reference only**. Implementation follows the **MVP User Stories & Client Q&A decisions**.

