## 🛠️ Detailed User Story & Feature Implementation Breakdown

Here is the exact step-by-step specification for how each module will be built and function in the mobile application:

### 1. User Accounts & Authentication Module
- **Sign Up & Account Creation:** Email + password registration form optimized for touch input.
- **Email Verification:** System sends a verification link/OTP to confirm valid email address before full platform access.
- **Login / Logout & Session:** Token-based authentication (JWT or session cookie) with "Remember Me" option.
- **Password Recovery:** "Forgot Password" workflow generating a secure reset token via email.
- **Profile & Password Edits:** Users can update credentials, security settings, and profile details anytime.
- **Account Deletion:** Self-service account deletion option adhering to GDPR compliance.

### 2. User Profile & Data Model
Every user profile will store and display the following fields:
- **Profile Photo & Gallery:** 1 main profile avatar + photo gallery carousel.
- **Basic Metadata:** Display Name (*Pseudo*), Age, City (Text name only).
- **Location Privacy:** Exact street address and live GPS tracks are **never** collected or shown. Distance calculations take place in the background using city Lat/Long coordinates.
- **Bio & Goal Selection:** Short description text + multi-select dropdown for site goals:
  - `Discuter`
  - `Partager mon expérience`
  - `Apprendre`
  - `Rencontrer de nouvelles personnes`
- **Expertise Level:** Single-select dropdown (`Débutant`, `Amateur`, `Intermédiaire`, `Expérimenté`, `Expert`).
- **Languages Spoken:** Multi-select language tags.
- **Topics Offered vs. Hobbies (2 Distinct Tag Lists):**
  - **Sujets proposés:** Specific topics the user offers to meet up and discuss. (New user-created topics are auto-approved for MVP).
  - **Intérêts:** Personal passions and hobbies.
- **Availability Selection:** Multi-choice list (`Tous les jours`, `En semaine`, `Week-end`, `Matin`, `Après-midi`, `Soir`). *No interactive calendar picker for MVP.*
- **Travel Radius & Spots:** Preferred meeting spot types (Café, Park, Library) and max displacement radius in **Kilometers (KM)**.
- **Fixed Meeting Rates:** Single global rate card per user for 4 predefined time durations:
  - 15 Minutes (€)
  - 30 Minutes (€)
  - 1 Hour (€)
  - 2 Hours (€)

### 3. Search & Discovery Engine
- **Search Parameters:** Filter by Topic, City, Max Distance Radius (KM), Price Range, Availability.
- **Filtering Logic:** Strict **AND logic** (all active filters must be satisfied simultaneously).
- **Distance Calculation:** Spherical distance math based on searching user's city Lat/Long vs. candidate's city Lat/Long.
- **Results Display:** Touch-friendly card view showing profile picture, name, age, city, distance from user (e.g. `à 2.3 km`), main topic tags, and hourly rate.

### 4. Explorer Directory
- Scrollable list of user profiles.
- **Sorting Mechanisms:**
  - Most Recent (*Plus récents*)
  - Proximity / Distance (*Distance*)
  - Price (*Prix*)

### 5. Private Messaging & Safety Module
- **1-on-1 Chat Threads:** Direct messaging between connected users.
- **Supported Media:** Text messages and Photo attachments (Videos & document files excluded for MVP).
- **Read Receipts:** Visual indicator (*accusé de lecture*) when a message is read.
- **User Safety Controls:**
  - **Instant Block:** Immediately hides conversation and blocks all future contact.
  - **Report User:** Submits a report flag to the admin queue for review.

### 6. Administration & Moderation
- **User Operations:** View user list, suspend user accounts, or permanently delete accounts.
- **Report Audit Queue:** View user reports, read flagged message context, and take action (dismiss/suspend).
- **Topic Management:** Overview of user-submitted and system topic tags.

### 7. Information & Static Pages
- How It Works (*Comment ça marche*)
- Trust Charter (*Charte de confiance*)
- Terms of Service (*CGU*) & Privacy Policy
- Contact & FAQ

